{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And you shall offer a goat.</b> I might have thought the seven lambs and the goat mentioned here are the seven lambs and the goat mentioned in the Book of Numbers — but when you reach the bulls and rams, they are not the same. Conclude from this: these are on their own and those are on their own — these were offered on account of the bread, and those for the additional offerings (there)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:57.689516540Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}